From 328aa6605a44acf5c4abddad47564d76c5e00326 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 05:44:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] docs: v0.1.3.1 run docs match the shipped tree and the gate
 receipts

HOW-WE-RUN.md: the Radeon 890M numbers and command lines now cite the v0.1.3.1 gate (evidence/v0.1.3.1/pg-*-state.json and pg-*-READ.txt); the depth-6 DFlash2 rows state their depth-3 and depth-4 baselines with the receipt rounds; every claim without a receipt in this repository is removed. ENVIRONMENT.md gains GGML_ARIFI_MOE_GATHER_EXT, GGML_ARIFI_QSA_MASKFUSE and LLAMA_ARIFI_KV_ZERO_FREED, and every Source citation is regenerated from the getenv sites of this tree. WINDOWS-SETTINGS.md keeps only claims a reader can check. docs/BUILDING.md: the Vulkan build line gains the ROCmFPX and TQ weight-format options. docs/OPTIONS-REGISTRY.md: the web UI comes from the pinned tools/ui/dist.tar.gz.

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release documentation for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - documents only; no code path is touched.
